 "standard_url": "https://www.cbseacademic.nic.in/web_material/CurriculumMain26/SrSec/Maths_SrSec_2025-26.pdf",
 "standard_text": "Integration as inverse process of differentiation; integration of a variety of functions by substitution, by partial fractions and by parts; evaluation of simple integrals of particular types (dx/(x² ± a²), dx/√(a² − x²) and others); fundamental theorem of calculus (without proof); basic properties of definite integrals and evaluation of definite integrals (summary of the CBSE syllabus)",
 "meta_desc": "Class 12 Integrals worksheet (NCERT Chapter 7): standard integrals, substitution, special forms, partial fractions, integration by parts and definite integrals. 100 questions with answers.",
 "key_big": "∫ xⁿ dx = xⁿ⁺¹/(n + 1) + C (n ≠ −1).",
 "key_sub": "∫ₐᵇ f(x) dx = F(b) − F(a).",
 "body_html": "<h2>How it works</h2><ul><li>Integration reverses differentiation: ∫ <i>x</i><sup>n</sup> d<i>x</i> = <i>x</i><sup>n+1</sup>/(n + 1) + C, ∫ 1/<i>x</i> d<i>x</i> = log|<i>x</i>| + C, ∫ e<sup><i>x</i></sup> d<i>x</i> = e<sup><i>x</i></sup> + C.</li><li>∫ sin k<i>x</i> d<i>x</i> = −(1/k) cos k<i>x</i> + C; ∫ cos k<i>x</i> d<i>x</i> = (1/k) sin k<i>x</i> + C.</li><li><b>Substitution</b>: if the integrand has g(<i>x</i>) and g′(<i>x</i>), put t = g(<i>x</i>).</li><li><b>Standard forms</b>: ∫ d<i>x</i>/(<i>x</i>² + a²) = (1/a) tan<sup>−1</sup>(<i>x</i>/a); ∫ d<i>x</i>/√(a² − <i>x</i>²) = sin<sup>−1</sup>(<i>x</i>/a).</li><li><b>By parts</b>: ∫ u v d<i>x</i> = u∫v d<i>x</i> − ∫(u′∫v d<i>x</i>) d<i>x</i>. <b>Definite</b>: ∫<sub>a</sub><sup>b</sup> f = F(b) − F(a); for an odd f, ∫<sub>−a</sub><sup>a</sup> f = 0.</li></ul><div class='sn-ex'><span class='sn-ex-t'>Example</span><p class='sn-ex-q'>Evaluate ∫ <i>x</i> e<sup><i>x</i></sup> d<i>x</i>.</p><p class='sn-ex-s'>u = <i>x</i>, v = e<sup><i>x</i></sup></p><p class='sn-ex-s'><i>x</i>e<sup><i>x</i></sup> − ∫ e<sup><i>x</i></sup> d<i>x</i></p><p class='sn-ex-a'>Answer: e<sup><i>x</i></sup>(<i>x</i> − 1) + C</p></div><h2>Common mistakes</h2><ul><li>Writing ∫ xⁿ dx = xⁿ⁺¹/n.</li><li>Forgetting to divide by k in ∫ sin kx dx.</li><li>Working out F(a) − F(b) for a definite integral.</li></ul>",
 "faq": [
